1
00:00:00,174 --> 00:00:02,764
What if India stopped buying
oil from other countries?

2
00:00:02,954 --> 00:00:04,804
India imports roughly eighty five percent

3
00:00:05,234 --> 00:00:06,664
of the crude oil it uses.

4
00:00:06,790 --> 00:00:09,690
Almost every bus, truck,
bike and car runs on it.

5
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:13,160
If imports stopped,
petrol pumps would run dry within weeks.

6
00:00:13,346 --> 00:00:14,556
Trucks that carry vegetables,

7
00:00:15,006 --> 00:00:17,396
milk and grain would slow down or stop.

8
00:00:17,511 --> 00:00:19,061
Factories would cut production.

9
00:00:19,247 --> 00:00:20,457
Flights would be cancelled.

10
00:00:20,617 --> 00:00:23,907
Even many power plants and
cooking gas supplies would be hit.

11
00:00:23,907 --> 00:00:25,367
Prices of everything would climb,

12
00:00:25,367 --> 00:00:29,177
because everything has to be
moved from somewhere to somewhere.

13
00:00:29,183 --> 00:00:32,173
A single country's oil decides
how your whole day moves.

14
00:00:32,238 --> 00:00:34,308
So what if India stopped importing oil?

